{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25858","headline":"宿瓜州 · 李绅","name":"宿瓜州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟昏水郭津亭晚，回望金陵若动摇。\n冲浦回风翻宿浪，照沙低月歛残潮。\n柳经寒露看萧索，人改衰容自寂寥。\n官冷旧谙唯旅馆，岁阴轻薄是凉飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}